# MINCECRAFT recipe sheet — TEMPLATE ONLY.
#
# The real file lives OUTSIDE this repo, on the Pi:
#     ~/.config/mincecraft/recipes.env
# install-pi.sh copies this template there the first time. Then paste the
# owner's Google Sheet link (the address bar link while the sheet is open).
#
# The sheet must be shared as "Anyone with the link: Viewer". Keep the link
# out of this public repo: anyone holding it can read the recipes.
# With no link set, recipes come from DOKI-Recipes.xlsx on GitHub (main).

RECIPES_SHEET_URL=PASTE-THE-GOOGLE-SHEET-LINK-HERE
